==Creating the 3D model of the mechanical cam== <!--T:46-->

<!--T:47-->
You can extrude the sketch and add some other features in order to create the 3D model of the cam. The picture below illustrates a cam with a hole, in order to be mounted to a shaft. You can add more details e.g. by splitting the cam in two parts and mounting them together using screws, in order to clamp the cam to the shaft.

</translate>
